1
00:00:00,501 --> 00:00:03,811
(Sheldon:)Obi-Wan Kenobi is a character
from Star Wars.

2
00:00:03,971 --> 00:00:07,081
(Sheldon:)After his physical demise,
he comes to Luke Skywalker

3
00:00:07,241 --> 00:00:09,851
(Sheldon:)as his mentor in spirit form.

4
00:00:11,212 --> 00:00:13,552
(Arthur:)Well, that...
that clears that up.

5
00:00:16,050 --> 00:00:18,360
(Sheldon:)You must be here
to give me advice.

6
00:00:24,859 --> 00:00:26,769
(Arthur:)Well, this... this is weird.

7
00:00:27,695 --> 00:00:30,265
Most-most of my robes open in...

8
00:00:30,431 --> 00:00:32,171
(Arthur:)...in the back.

9
00:00:34,602 --> 00:00:36,912
(Sheldon:)Those are your Jedi robes.

10
00:00:39,040 --> 00:00:41,040
Wait. What...?

11
00:00:41,209 --> 00:00:43,419
What... what is this?

12
00:00:44,512 --> 00:00:46,052
Be careful with that!

13
00:00:46,948 --> 00:00:48,398
Whoa! (CHUCKLES)

14
00:00:59,460 --> 00:01:06,030
(Arthur:)Neato.

